Version 4
SHEET 1 1880 1000
FLAG 96 176 bat
FLAG 96 256 0
FLAG 224 160 bat
FLAG 224 240 lx
FLAG 320 160 lx
FLAG 320 240 sw
FLAG 432 160 sw
FLAG 432 224 out
FLAG 528 160 out
FLAG 528 240 cx
FLAG 624 256 cx
FLAG 624 320 0
FLAG 720 176 out
FLAG 720 256 0
FLAG 880 176 ramp
FLAG 880 256 0
SYMBOL voltage 96 160 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vbat
SYMATTR Value {Vin}
SYMBOL res 208 144 R0
SYMATTR InstName Rdcr
SYMATTR Value 0.05
SYMBOL ind 304 144 R0
SYMATTR InstName L1
SYMATTR Value 10u
SYMBOL schottky 416 160 R0
SYMATTR InstName D1
SYMATTR Value SS14
SYMBOL res 512 144 R0
SYMATTR InstName Resr
SYMATTR Value 0.15
SYMBOL cap 608 256 R0
SYMATTR InstName Cout
SYMATTR Value 220u
SYMBOL res 704 160 R0
SYMATTR InstName Rload
SYMATTR Value {Rl}
SYMBOL voltage 880 160 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vramp
SYMATTR Value PULSE(0.03 1 0 1.99u 5n 0 2u)
TEXT 32 8 Left 3 ;Li-ion 3.7 V -> 5.0 V boost converter with PI control and load step
TEXT 32 40 Left 2 ;Boost converter (MT3608-style, 500 kHz) keeps the ESP32 rail at 5.0 V while the battery falls 4.2 -> 3.3 V.
TEXT 32 68 Left 2 ;Plot V(out), V(bat), I(L1). Try .step param Vin list 3.3 3.7 4.2 to see regulation across the battery range.
TEXT 32 560 Left 2 ;Output capacitor: 220 uF electrolytic, its 0.15 ohm ESR damps the LC resonance
TEXT 32 588 Left 2 ;Power MOSFET as a switch, driven by the PWM comparator below (500 kHz)
TEXT 32 616 Left 2 !S1 sw 0 duty ramp NSW
TEXT 32 644 Left 2 !.model NSW SW(Ron=0.06 Roff=1Meg Vt=0 Vh=0.01)
TEXT 32 672 Left 2 !.model SS14 D(Is=5u Rs=0.04 N=1.05 Cjo=110p)
TEXT 32 700 Left 2 ;PI controller: integrator node 'integ' + proportional term, duty clamped 0..0.85
TEXT 32 728 Left 2 ;Feedback low-pass filter (removes switching ripple before the controller)
TEXT 32 756 Left 2 !Rf out fb 1k
TEXT 32 784 Left 2 !Cf fb 0 10n
TEXT 32 812 Left 2 ;Soft-start reference: ramps from the battery voltage up to 5.0 V over 1 ms
TEXT 32 840 Left 2 !Vref ref 0 PWL(0 {Vin} 1m 5.0)
TEXT 32 868 Left 2 ;Integral control (~500 Hz crossover) with anti-windup: integrator stops at 0 and 0.85 duty
TEXT 32 896 Left 2 !Bint 0 integ I=0.5u*( max(V(ref)-V(fb),0)*min(1,max(0,(0.85-V(integ))*50)) + min(V(ref)-V(fb),0)*min(1,max(0,V(integ)*50)) )
TEXT 32 924 Left 2 !Cint integ 0 1n
TEXT 32 952 Left 2 !Rleak integ 0 1G
TEXT 32 980 Left 2 !Bduty dutyr 0 V=min(0.85, max(0, V(integ)))
TEXT 32 1008 Left 2 !Rd dutyr duty 100
TEXT 32 1036 Left 2 !Cd duty 0 100p
TEXT 32 1064 Left 2 ;PWM comparator is built into S1: switch closes while V(duty) > V(ramp) (0-1 V sawtooth)
TEXT 32 1092 Left 2 !.param Vin=3.7 Rl=20
TEXT 32 1120 Left 2 !.ic V(integ)=0.1 V(out)=3.4 V(cx)=3.4 V(fb)=3.4
TEXT 32 1148 Left 2 ;Load step: extra 250 mA (ESP32 WiFi transmit burst) at 3.5 ms on top of the 250 mA base
TEXT 32 1176 Left 2 !Sload out lstep lctl 0 NSW
TEXT 32 1204 Left 2 !Rstep lstep 0 20
TEXT 32 1232 Left 2 !Vlctl lctl 0 PULSE(-1 1 3.5m 1u 1u 10 20)
TEXT 32 1260 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout_avg AVG V(out) FROM=3m TO=3.5m
TEXT 32 1288 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout_ripple PP V(out) FROM=3m TO=3.5m
TEXT 32 1316 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout_min_on_step MIN V(out) FROM=3.5m TO=4.5m
TEXT 32 1344 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout_after_step AVG V(out) FROM=5.5m TO=6m
TEXT 32 1372 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Iin_avg AVG I(Vbat) FROM=3m TO=3.5m
TEXT 32 1400 Left 2 !.tran 10n 6m 0 20n uic
